# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Node (GNOME Shell extension toolchain)
node_modules/
/shell/*/dist/

# Python bytecode (packaging/licenses.py and other helper scripts)
**/__pycache__/

# Build outputs
/_build/
# Mockup renders: derived, about 32 MB (`just design-render`, tools/design/render-mockup.cjs)
/design/renders/
/out/
*.qcow2
*.raw
*.iso
*.oci/
# The RPMs image/Containerfile reads from the build context (.github/scripts/image.sh
# context fills it from the apex-rpms and apex-libfprint artifacts)
/rpms/

# Private keys never belong in the repository: `cosign generate-key-pair` writes
# cosign.key next to cosign.pub (image/system_files/usr/share/apex/keys/README.md).
cosign.key
*.key
*.key.bak

# Biometric data never belongs in the repository (ADR 0006, THREAT-MODEL T6,
# docs/hardware/FINGERPRINT.md): fingerprint images, enrolled prints, umockdev
# recordings, usbmon captures and fprintd's print store, in any letter case. CI's
# .github/scripts/privacy-guard.sh fails on the same names, and on hex dumps and long
# lines inside text files, which no ignore pattern can catch.
*.[Pp][Gg][Mm]
*.[Vv][Aa][Rr][Ii][Aa][Nn][Tt]
*.[Ii][Oo][Cc][Tt][Ll]
*.[Uu][Mm][Oo][Cc][Kk][Dd][Ee][Vv]
*.[Pp][Cc][Aa][Pp]
*.[Pp][Cc][Aa][Pp][Nn][Gg]
**/var/lib/fprint/

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
